[
  {
    "goto": "#box"
  },
  {
    "click": "#tabs button[data-t=\"mem\"]"
  },
  {
    "goto": "#memBox"
  },
  {
    "eval": "(()=>{const g=s=>(document.getElementById(s)||{}).innerText||'';return JSON.stringify({project:g('memPath').slice(0,4),global:g('gPath').slice(0,4),skills:g('skillList').slice(0,10),pathsShown:g('memPath').length>0&&g('gPath').length>0})})()",
    "must": [
      "pathsShown"
    ],
    "note": "记忆页签一开就要看得见两条路径（项目那份与全局那份），技能区没内容也要写明「还没有技能」而不是空一块"
  },
  {
    "shot": "m01-memory-tab"
  },
  {
    "type": {
      "sel": "#memBox",
      "text": "构建只用 gradlew.bat；不要改 build/ 下的任何文件。",
      "enter": false
    }
  },
  {
    "click": "#memSave"
  },
  {
    "sleep": 900
  },
  {
    "eval": "(()=>{const s=document.getElementById('memState').innerText;return JSON.stringify({state:s,path:document.getElementById('memPath').innerText.slice(0,4),savedOk:s.indexOf('已存')>=0,takesEffect:s.indexOf('生效')>=0})})()",
    "must": [
      "savedOk",
      "takesEffect"
    ],
    "note": "存完要说两件事：存了多少字、从下一条消息起生效。只回「已保存」不够——人不知道有没有真的落盘、什么时候起作用"
  },
  {
    "type": {
      "sel": "#gBox",
      "text": "回答一律用中文，短句优先。",
      "enter": false
    }
  },
  {
    "click": "#gSave"
  },
  {
    "sleep": 900
  },
  {
    "eval": "Promise.all([fetch('/api/memory?scope=global').then(r=>r.json())]).then(a=>JSON.stringify({readBack:a[0].text,at:a[0].path.split(String.fromCharCode(92)).slice(-1),ok:a[0].text.indexOf('回答一律用中文')>=0,inFile:a[0].path.indexOf('MEMORY.md')>=0}))",
    "must": [
      "ok",
      "inFile"
    ],
    "note": "全局记忆那句要**从盘上读回来**（不是界面自己记着），而且落在 MEMORY.md 这个文件名上——界面上写着存了、盘上没有，是这类功能最坏的坏法"
  },
  {
    "shot": "m02-memory-saved"
  },
  {
    "type": {
      "sel": "#skName",
      "text": "review",
      "enter": false
    }
  },
  {
    "type": {
      "sel": "#skDesc",
      "text": "先给我看这次改动的问题",
      "enter": false
    }
  },
  {
    "type": {
      "sel": "#skText",
      "text": "把刚才那一轮改动的文件逐个 read 回来，指出：1) 有没有改错的地方 2) 有没有漏掉的调用点。不要直接动手改。",
      "enter": false
    }
  },
  {
    "click": "#skSave"
  },
  {
    "sleep": 900
  },
  {
    "eval": "(()=>{const rows=document.querySelectorAll('#skillList .rl').length;const st=document.getElementById('skState').innerText;return JSON.stringify({rows,state:st,one:rows==1,slashHint:st.indexOf('/')>=0})})()",
    "must": [
      "one",
      "slashHint"
    ],
    "note": "存完技能列表该正好一条，并且状态那句要告诉人怎么用（打 / 就能用）——只说「保存成功」等于把下一步留给人猜"
  },
  {
    "eval": "(()=>{const b=document.getElementById('box');b.value='/rev';b.dispatchEvent(new Event('input',{bubbles:true}))})()"
  },
  {
    "sleep": 500
  },
  {
    "eval": "(()=>{const t=document.querySelector('#slash').innerText;return JSON.stringify({menu:t.replace(/\\s+/g,' | ').slice(0,80),hasSkill:t.indexOf('技能')>=0,hasReview:t.indexOf('review')>=0})})()",
    "must": [
      "hasSkill",
      "hasReview"
    ],
    "note": "刚存的技能要出现在 / 菜单里，并且**标出它是技能**（技能和命令混在一列时，人分不清该点哪个）"
  },
  {
    "shot": "m03-slash-with-skill"
  },
  {
    "click": "#slash .it:last-child"
  },
  {
    "sleep": 400
  },
  {
    "eval": "(()=>{const v=document.getElementById('box').value;return JSON.stringify({filled:v.slice(0,24),ok:v.indexOf('把刚才那一轮')>=0})})()",
    "must": [
      "ok"
    ],
    "note": "点菜单里那条之后，输入框里填进去的是**技能正文**而不是技能名——填成名字的话人以为成功了，模型收到的却是一句标题"
  },
  {
    "shot": "m04-skill-inserted"
  },
  {
    "eval": "(()=>{const b=document.getElementById('box');b.value='';b.dispatchEvent(new Event('input',{bubbles:true}))})()"
  },
  {
    "click": "#skillList [data-sk]"
  },
  {
    "sleep": 700
  },
  {
    "eval": "(()=>{const rows=document.querySelectorAll('#skillList .rl').length;return JSON.stringify({rows,gone:rows==0})})()",
    "must": [
      "gone"
    ],
    "note": "删完列表要真的空掉（期望是 0，所以判据自己算成布尔：must 里写 rows 会把「删干净了」判成失败）"
  }
]
